        "content": "<p>myunbin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14277\">PR #14277</a> from <code>myunbin:add-rules-260904</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Add new opt rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>(x - y) == 0 ==&gt; x == y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x - y) != 0 ==&gt; x != y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x ^ y) == 0 ==&gt; x == y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x ^ y) != 0 ==&gt; x != y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x ^ y) == x ==&gt; y == 0</code></li>\n<li><code>(x + y) != x ==&gt; y != 0</code></li>\n<li><code>x != -y ==&gt; x != y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x == y) ? 0 : (x - y) ==&gt; x - y</code></li>\n<li><code>(c ? y : z) + (c ? z : y) ==&gt; z + y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x != y) ? (x - y) : 0 ==&gt; x - y</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Apply <code>all_zero</code> helper for existing rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>x &amp; 0 == 0 &amp; x == x &amp; not(x) == not(x) &amp; x == 0.</code></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
